<title>POLAND: Apator Q2 net rises to PLN 1.5 mln.</title>
<headline>Apator Q2 net rises to PLN 1.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Apator preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 2.36 vs	2.92</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   2.56 vs	2.11</p>
<p>    net profit				 1.51 vs	0.63</p>
<p>    net sales				 20.16 vs     17.04</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  17.55 vs     15.34</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		     0.01 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				 1.05 vs	1.48</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     2.56 vs	0.33</p>
<p>    financial costs			  2.35 vs	1.13</p>
<p>    investment				 2.33 vs	1.13</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 6.27 vs	5.24</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   2.56 vs	2.11</p>
<p>    net profit				 4.30 vs	1.93</p>
<p>    net sales				 39.38 vs     34.76</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  32.65 vs     30.66</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		     0.02 vs	0.01 profit</p>
<p>    income tax				 2.15 vs	2.10</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     2.99 vs	0.38</p>
<p>    financial costs			  2.80 vs	1.60</p>
<p>    investment				 3.97 vs	1.25</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Apator SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
